{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人龔嘉欣及陳曉華昨現身無綫台慶綵排，前者負責向幕後工作人員致敬，後者則要表演跳舞。</p><p>嘉欣表示：「我嗰part關於表揚動作指導及武師，我唔使即場打，但相信幾感動，以前拍《殺手》我試手指筋斷，且埋腳縫咗3針，到時都會剪番相關畫面出嚟重溫。</p><p>（留咗</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:44:16.485480+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:35:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:37:15.079726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:37:15.079726+00:00","content_hash":"cd00cce9a25174a3c8d35d7e39ea3b88f5ef394cf11594bd14a6f36b1a6b9408","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}